# Graph store

See also always-on rule `deploy.mdc`.

`graph/nodes.json` on the **host** is the live canon. Keepers punch `WRITE_CANON` there. This checkout goes stale until you pull.

## Before editing or asking Jack about records

```bash
./scripts/graph-pull
```

## Deploy

- Never replace live graph JSON from this checkout.
- Use `./scripts/graph-push-merge` only when deliberately adding local records up.
